  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Climate Resilience in Peru through Enhanced Climate Information Services and Capacity Building for Climate Change Monitoring and Prediction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will involve three workshops and two capacity-building sessions targeting relevant government departments and partner institutions. The aim is to establish a mid-to-long term roadmap with a vision for advancing climate information services and strengthening climate monitoring and forecasting capabilities. Through this initiative, we will share Korea&apos;s development experience and transfer climate forecasting technologies, with the goal of improving Peru&apos;s institutional conditions and contributing to sustainable development and the resolution of global climate challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance Peru&apos;s meteorological information services by modernizing the climate data collection and processing systems, thereby establishing a rapid information dissemination and decision-making framework&#xc911;&#xc7a5;&#xae30; &#xbc1c;&#xc804; &#xb85c;&#xb4dc;&#xb9f5; &#xc218;&#xb9bd;, &#xc6b0;&#xc120;&#xc21c;&#xc704; &#xc0ac;&#xc5c5; &#xb3c4;&#xcd9c;, &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654;&#xb300;&#xc751; &#xbc0f; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xc815;&#xbcf4;&#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc815;&#xcc45; &#xb0b4;&#xc2e4;&#xc81c;&#xace0; &#xbc0f; &#xbc29;&#xd5a5;&#xc131; &#xac1c;&#xc120;, &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xc815;&#xbcf4;&#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xb0b4;&#xc7ac;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xc5c5;&#xbb34;&#xc2a4;&#xd0ac; &#xace0;&#xb3c4;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
